{"attempt":1,"diagnostics":[],"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","feedback":["CRITIC DIAGNOSTIC REPAIR: The mathematical_specification statement fails to elaborate because def Output := Int is not unfolded for synthesis of OfNat Output 0, OfNat Output 4 and Neg Output. In this formalize phase, replace def Output := Int with abbrev Output := Int, preserving the exact integer result type and all existing mathematical guarantees. Alternatively, explicitly type each output numeral as Int: (0 : Int) and (-4 : Int). Recheck elaboration before attempting proofs; these diagnostics are type-class failures, not functional counterexamples."],"milestone_authority":false,"phase":"formalize","results":[{"agent":"critic","checked":null,"instance":"critic/formalize/1/R0/group-1/critic/1","proposal":{"corrections":[{"artifact":"proposal.lean","diagnostic_index":0,"explanation":"The mathematical_specification statement fails to elaborate because def Output := Int is not unfolded for synthesis of OfNat Output 0, OfNat Output 4 and Neg Output. In this formalize phase, replace def Output := Int with abbrev Output := Int, preserving the exact integer result type and all existing mathematical guarantees. Alternatively, explicitly type each output numeral as Int: (0 : Int) and (-4 : Int). Recheck elaboration before attempting proofs; these diagnostics are type-class failures, not functional counterexamples."}],"counterexamples":[],"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR"},"status":"REPAIR","tier":"R0"}],"status":"REPAIR","tiers":[{"abstains":0,"accepts":0,"blocking_findings":["critic/formalize/1/R0/group-1/critic/1"],"members":1,"missing":[],"reasons":["unresolved blocking findings veto: critic/formalize/1/R0/group-1/critic/1"],"rejects":1,"result":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","tier":"R0"}]}